SUMMARY:Deadline: The Stringer Awards 2027: multi-year unrestricted cash aw
 ards for journalists and creative practitioners exposing abuses of power (
 aiming for USD 9\,000-100\,000)
DESCRIPTION:The Stringer Foundation gives multi-year\, unrestricted cash aw
 ards to people who use public media to expose abuses of power and injustic
 es that harm the public\, while upholding the truth.\n\nOrganisation: The 
 Stringer Foundation\nLocation: Worldwide. Applications accepted in any lan
 guage.\nAward: Multi-year\, unrestricted cash awards\; the foundation aims
  for grants between USD 9\,000 and USD 100\,000\, depending on funds raise
 d. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Multi-year award\n\nMore: http
 s://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdSjm0YTlJh0oYUDYHC8xJltAodMZAs9pBbXw
 qRCIusV7xcFw/viewform?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=ref
 erral
